        "original_id": "6ebc41b8-9619-5de3-a756-271ce21c4627",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Erik Watts, Bill Watts, Scott Anton, Glacier, Jorge Estrada\n- Organizations: WWE, TCW\n- Products: TCW Tag Team Championship, TCW Heavyweight Championship\n- Places: Dothan, Alabama\n\nFacts:\n- Bill Watts, whose full name is William F. Watts Jr., was born on May 5, 1939.\n- Bill Watts is an American former professional wrestler, promoter, and WWE Hall of Fame inductee from 2009.\n- Erik Watts is the son of Bill Watts.\n- On March 3, 2001, Scott Anton and Erik Watts originally won the TCW Tag Team Championship in Dothan, Alabama.\n- Scott Anton and Erik Watts won the TCW Tag Team Championship by defeating Glacier and Jorge Estrada.\n- Glacier and Jorge Estrada were also opponents for the TCW Heavyweight Championship.",
